---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const faqs = [["Do I need a trademark to get a VMC?", "Yes. The logo must be a registered trademark with a government trademark office. This is verified during the VMC issuance process."], ["Is a CMC cheaper than a VMC?", "Yes. Common Mark Certificates have less stringent verification requirements and may be available for some providers without a full trademark registration."]];

const article = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: "BIMI VMC Certificate",
  description: "BIMI VMC certificate: Verified Mark Certificate requirements, providers (DigiCert, Entrust) and pricing.",
  inLanguage: 'en',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'PromptDNS', url: 'https://promptdns.com/' },
  publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'PromptDNS', url: 'https://promptdns.com/', logo: { '@type': 'ImageObject', url: 'https://promptdns.com/favicon.svg' } },
  datePublished: '2026-10-27',
  dateModified: '2026-10-27',
};

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {'@type': 'Question', 'name': "Do I need a trademark to get a VMC?", "acceptedAnswer": { '@type': 'Answer', "text": "Yes. The logo must be a registered trademark with a government trademark office. This is verified during the VMC issuance process." } },
    {'@type': 'Question', 'name': "Is a CMC cheaper than a VMC?", "acceptedAnswer": { '@type': 'Answer', "text": "Yes. Common Mark Certificates have less stringent verification requirements and may be available for some providers without a full trademark registration." } },
    {'@type': 'Question', 'name': "Can I use a CMC instead of a VMC?", "acceptedAnswer": { '@type': 'Answer', "text": "A Common Mark Certificate is accepted by some providers with lighter trademark verification. Gmail requires the full VMC, so check your target inboxes first." } }
  ],
};

const breadcrumbs = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://promptdns.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Email Authentication', item: 'https://promptdns.com/email-authentication/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: "BIMI VMC Certificate" },
  ],
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="BIMI VMC Certificate: Verified Mark Certificate Requirements and Providers"
  description="BIMI VMC certificate: Verified Mark Certificate requirements, providers (DigiCert, Entrust) and pricing."
  schema={[article, faqSchema, breadcrumbs]}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-4 text-sm text-ink-faint" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-accent">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/email-authentication/" class="hover:text-accent">Email Authentication</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="text-ink-dim">BIMI VMC Certificate</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">BIMI VMC Certificate</h1>
    <div class="pd-answer" data-vs="answer">
      <p class="text-lg text-ink-dim">BIMI VMC certificate: Verified Mark Certificate requirements, providers and pricing for Gmail BIMI.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="not-prose my-8" aria-label="Reference table">
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-lg sm:p-7 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class='pdns-table' style='width:100%'><thead><tr><th class='whitespace-nowrap'>Provider</th><th class='whitespace-nowrap'>VMC Price (approx.)</th><th class='whitespace-nowrap'>CMC Available</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='pd-mono'>DigiCert</td><td>$1,000-1,500/year</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td class='pd-mono'>Entrust</td><td>$1,000-1,500/year</td><td>Yes (for some providers)</td></tr><tr><td class='pd-mono'>MarkValidator (via SSL.com)</td><td>Varies</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="rich-text mt-10 max-w-none">
      <h2>Technical details</h2>
      <p class='mt-3'>A Verified Mark Certificate (VMC) is a digital certificate issued by a trusted certificate authority that validates the trademark ownership of a brand's logo for BIMI display in email inboxes.</p><p class='mt-3'>Gmail requires a VMC for BIMI logo display, while Apple Mail may accept a Common Mark Certificate (CMC) which has less stringent trademark verification requirements.</p><p class='mt-3'>The VMC issuance process requires a registered trademark for the logo, verification of the organization's legal identity, and a validation process similar to Extended Validation (EV) certificates.</p>

      <aside class="mt-8 rounded-xl border-l-3 border-l-violet/50 bg-violet/5 p-5" aria-label="Practitioner field notes">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-violet mb-2">Field notes</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim italic">The VMC is the most expensive part of BIMI deployment. For small organizations, the cost may not be justified until email volume and brand recognition make the logo display benefit worthwhile.</p>
      </aside>

      <h2 class="font-display mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3">
        <details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Do I need a trademark to get a VMC?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Yes. The logo must be a registered trademark with a government trademark office. This is verified during the VMC issuance process.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Is a CMC cheaper than a VMC?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Yes. Common Mark Certificates have less stringent verification requirements and may be available for some providers without a full trademark registration.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can I use a CMC instead of a VMC?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">A Common Mark Certificate is accepted by some providers with lighter trademark verification. Gmail requires the full VMC, so check your target inboxes first.</p></details>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-ink-faint">
        Check your domain with our free tools:
        <a href="/spf-record-checker/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-soft">SPF checker</a>,
        <a href="/dmarc-record-checker/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-soft">DMARC checker</a>,
        <a href="/dkim-record-checker/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-soft">DKIM checker</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
